From: AnxeloK <95703440+AnxeloK@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 20:32:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refine compatibility dispatch

Keep compatibility callbacks ordered under contention, avoid permanent refusal from transient cycles, and reduce diagnostic and per-event overhead.

